@startuml
title Aero_EWS 2.0 - Multi-Agent Intelligence Workflow

autonumber

actor "Human Analyst" as Human
participant "Web Dashboard" as UI
participant "FastAPI Backend" as API
participant "Chief Intelligence Planner" as Planner
participant "OSINT Collection" as OSINT
participant "Semantic Filter" as Filter
participant "Aviation Risk Analyst" as Risk
participant "Quality Assurance Agent" as QA
participant "Executive Editor" as Editor
participant "Scoring Agent" as Scoring
participant "Deterministic Harness" as Harness
database "SQLite / Evidence Archive" as DB

Human -> UI: Define KIT and time scope
UI -> API: POST /run-ews

API -> Planner: Generate KIQ search strategy
Planner --> API: KIQPlan

API -> OSINT: Collect public source evidence
OSINT -> DB: Store collected documents
OSINT --> API: Source records

API -> Filter: Evaluate source relevance
Filter --> API: Relevant document batches

API -> Risk: Analyze collected evidence
Risk --> API: Candidate ThreatAssessments

API -> QA: Review candidate assessments
QA --> API: QA findings

opt Corrective agent feedback enabled
    API -> Risk: Request evidence-grounded correction
    Risk --> API: Revised candidate assessments
    API -> QA: Recheck revised assessments
    QA --> API: Updated QA findings
end

API -> Editor: Prepare executive synthesis
Editor --> API: Executive summary and action plan

API -> Scoring: Estimate potential severity
Scoring --> API: Risk scores

API -> Harness: Validate evidence and alert eligibility
Harness --> API: Verified classification and warnings

API -> DB: Reconcile event identities
API -> DB: Store report and audit metadata

API --> UI: Report waiting for human review
UI --> Human: Present evidence and recommendations

alt Report approved
    Human -> UI: Approve report
    UI -> API: POST /approve-ews
    API -> DB: Save approval and report version
    API --> UI: Publish report
else Report rejected
    Human -> UI: Reject report
    UI -> API: POST /approve-ews
    API -> DB: Record rejection
end

@enduml